{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","一箭封喉"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","奪命の矢"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对所有敌人造成伤害，对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提高并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵全体にダメージを与える。対象が「衰え」状態の場合、ダメージがUPし、さらにスタンを付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","波妮射出魔法箭，对每个敌人造成2次180% + 20% ATK伤害。魔法箭对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提升30%，并使其眩晕，持续3 + 0.25秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","魔法の矢を撃ち、敵全体を攻撃。敵1体につき、180% + 20% ATKのダメージを2回与える。対象が「衰え」状態の場合、魔法の矢によるダメージ+30%、さらに対象に3 + 0.25秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":84,"end":91,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが190% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが200% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","黯影衰朽"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","老衰の影"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使得最靠后的敌人获得“衰老”，降低急速，“衰老”的敌人受到其他魔法伤害时会增强“衰老”的效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","最も後ろにいる敵に「衰え」を付与し、対象の速度がDOWN。他の味方が「衰え」状態の敵に魔法ダメージを与えた場合、その「衰え」の効果が強化される"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，波妮对最靠后的敌人施加“衰老”魔法，对其造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并使其降低30点急速，持续到战斗结束，波妮会优先攻击这名敌人。\n每有其他友方英雄对“衰老”的敌人造成魔法伤害，会使其携带的“衰老”魔法进一步增强，额外降低10点急速。同一名友军至多使“衰老”魔法增强1次。通过这个方式，“衰老”魔法至多增强2次，且在增至最强后，使该敌人降低30% + 3%攻击力，并且每1秒受到100% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、最も後ろにいる敵に「衰え」の魔法を付与し、150% + 10% ATKのダメージを与え、永続的に対象の速度-30。自身は優先的にこの敵を攻撃\n自身以外の味方英雄が「衰え」状態の敵に魔法ダメージを与えるたびに、その「衰え」状態は強化され、追加で対象の速度-10。味方1体につき、1つの「衰え」状態を1回まで強化可能。また、1つの「衰え」状態はこの方法により、最大2回まで強化可能。「衰え」状態を最大まで強化した場合、さらに対象の敵は攻撃力-30% + 3%、1秒ごとに100% ATKのダメージを受ける"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":183,"end":188,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":228,"end":233,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":199,"end":207,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":239,"end":247,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが160% + 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが170% + 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_po